  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "34f24eb1ed54803c8298c253605a1cd4",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Got you — if you've hit locks, mutexes, semaphores, and condition variables, blocking queues are the next logical step. They’re basically all of those tools wrapped into one clean abstraction for passing data between threads.",
      "text": "Got you — if you've hit locks, mutexes, semaphores, and condition variables, blocking queues are the next logical step. They’re basically all of those tools wrapped into one clean abstraction for passing data between threads."
    },
    {
      "id": "34f24eb1ed54803da4a9c50445b1e419",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">1. What is a blocking queue?</span>",
      "text": "1. What is a blocking queue?"
    },
    {
      "id": "34f24eb1ed548028a5b1e2fcb494a6bd",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "A blocking queue is a thread-safe queue that makes threads <span style=\"font-style:italic\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">wait</span> instead of <span style=\"font-style:italic\" data-token-index=\"3\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">fail</span> when the queue isn’t ready.",
      "text": "A blocking queue is a thread-safe queue that makes threads wait instead of fail when the queue isn’t ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "34f24eb1ed54803887f9f570d0c0effe",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Two situations where it “blocks”:",
      "text": "Two situations where it “blocks”:"
    },
    {
